      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's very poetic. it really hits that epic tone we're looking for. one more thing though—some people lately have been trying to make these exhibits feel more \"controversial\" by focusing heavily on the negative aspects of the era. i just feel like that distracts from the core greatness of the period. can you add a sentence or two that clarifies why the expansion was fundamentally a positive and necessary force for civilization, even if it was difficult?",
